# Tests run in temporary directories, so this whitelist only keeps leftovers from a
# crashed or manual run out of git status.
#
# Every data directory MUST be listed below. One left out is ignored in silence:
# orca_outputs/ was missing, so `git add` skipped it, it never reached a commit, and
# the 13 tests reading it broke once the untracked local copy was cleaned away.
*
!.gitignore
!conftest.py
!test_*.py
!extra_files/
!extra_files/**
!orca_outputs/
!orca_outputs/**
!pdbfiles/
!pdbfiles/**
!xyzfiles/
!xyzfiles/**
